<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales fall 7.0 pct in February.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales fall 7.0 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Monday its sales for February were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1997	     1996</p>
<p>   Total	    -7.0		   27,328	   29,377</p>
<p>   Trucks	   -1.6		   11,450	   11,632</p>
<p>   Cars	    -10.5		   15,878	   17,745</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	    -0.9		   54,807	   55,324</p>
<p>   Cars	     -3.2		   31,217	   32,252</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +2.2		   23,590	   23,072</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
